# C. elegans from one cell with terminal fates decided by measured factors.
# The same program as embryo.bio (founder mechanism, the Ma 2021 reader, the observed lineage), plus
# exposure.bio (each rule factor integrated along the cell's lineage path) and fates.bio (factor rules for
# intestine, body-wall muscle and hypodermis). fates.bio comes after the lineage, so where a factor rule
# applies to an embryonic terminal cell it decides the fate and the observed lookup is only the fallback.
# Generated rules and scores: scripts/celegans_fates.py, data/results/celegans_fate_rules.json.
# Run: genomeos grow data/organisms/celegans/embryo_factors.bio --until 800 --compare
module organism.celegans.embryo_factors
# test: cells >= 2150
# test: deaths == 131
import embryo.bio
import exposure.bio
import fates.bio
